<section class="view home-view" data-page="home">
 <div class="hero">
  <img class="hero-image" src="/assets/tavern-hero.webp" alt="月光下的奇幻酒馆，暖金灯笼照亮暗木书架与魔法书桌" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✦</span> A LITTLE TAVERN, A WORLD OF CURIOSITY</p><div class="hero-wordmark"><Logo /></div><h1>比特酒馆</h1><p class="hero-line">记录所见，探索未至之境。</p><p class="hero-description">代码、故事，和那些让人好奇的世界。<br>这里留一盏灯，也留一张通往远方的地图。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/explore/dnd/">开始探索 <span>↗</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="/blog/">翻开新的记录 <span>→</span></a></div><p class="hero-foot"><span class="rune-dot"></span><span data-season-caption>一处停靠，两段旅程。</span></p></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>EST. 0101</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE <i>↓</i></span><span>WRITE · WANDER · WONDER</span></div>
